   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,883:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3.2 添加至 NVR (录像机)
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,883:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,883:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 进入 NVR 的“添加设备”或“自定义添加”界面。
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,883:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: IP 地址
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 填写运行本软件的服务器 IP (如 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 192.168.1.100
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,885:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  或公网映射 IP)。
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,885:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,885:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 端口
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,885:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 填写上述表格中的对应端口 (如 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 18000
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )。
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 协议
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,887:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 选择 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,887:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ONVIF
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,887:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 。
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 用户名
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: shadow
