   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,960:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,960:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,961:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: --output [DIR]
   DEBUG: 2026-01-29 14:14:20,961:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 视频保存目录 (默认: 
